OL,7,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales are on
OL,8,Ftheir first official visit to Bute,
OL,9,FScotland
OL,11,FAs part of their trip, William and
OL,12,FCatherine play the traditional sport
OL,13,Fshinty - Craig Harrower, who was there,
OL,14,Ftells us which royal won the penalty
OL,15,Fshootout
OL,17,FEarlier, opening a summit in Ayrshire,
OL,18,Fthe King warned tech bosses of the
OL,19,F"existential dangers" of AI falling
OL,20,Finto the wrong hands
